  "brief": {
    "situation": "You maintain ltv_model.xlsx at Lantern Audio Books (fictional). Each subscriber brings $12 margin a month and 92% stay each month. The sheet multiplies each month by 1.02, adding a 10% referral rate to retention, and sums 60 months: $1,370. Marketing will approve $400 per sign-up at 15:00. It is 14:05.",
    "handover": [
      "Referred friends are new subscribers and are counted in sign-up numbers already."
    ],
    "howItWorks": [
      "Pick a step from the action list: look, change, check or ship. Nothing you pick is typed or executed: every step shows an authored result.",
      "Each step takes working minutes, and the clock moves by the minutes it takes. The deadline runs on the same clock.",
      "Shipping is final for this case. Afterwards you record what you found and explain your reasoning."
    ]
  },
