    "modelReasoning": "A lifetime value that keeps growing with the horizon is a divergent series. The sheet's ratio is 1.02 because referrals were added to retention, but referred friends are new subscribers. With retention alone, r = 0.92, |r| < 1, and the series converges to 12/(1 - 0.92) = $150; partial sums confirm it. One year understates by a third; capping a divergent series at any month is arbitrary."
